<title>UK: German inland gas oil down, demand stagnant.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil down, demand stagnant.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.6287)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     39.10/39.40     24.00/24.19     39.80/40.20</p>
<p> BREMEN		39.10/39.40     24.00/24.19     40.00/40.40</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    38.50/38.90     23.63/23.88     39.30/39.70</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   39.30/39.60     24.12/24.31     40.50/40.90</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   39.70/40.10     24.37/24.62     40.50/40.90</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  41.70/42.10     25.60/25.84     42.40/42.80</p>
<p>German inland gas oil slid by up to one mark on Friday. Demand was lacklustre. Some waterways remain partially blocked by ice. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
